1
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,864
This program is intended for authorized F.A.L.C.O.N. personnel only.

2
00:00:14,564 --> 00:00:18,711
If you are not authorized personnel, please stop the tape now.

3
00:00:20,311 --> 00:00:21,024
Thank you.

4
00:00:25,324 --> 00:00:30,541
The Federal Agency for Liminal Classification & Occult Nature presents

5
00:00:32,341 --> 00:00:33,886
GOING IN, COMING OUT

6
00:00:38,686 --> 00:00:42,025
Before entering the poolrooms, sign in at reception.

7
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:43,981
Write down the time.

8
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:47,145
Collect your field kit.

9
00:00:49,445 --> 00:00:50,711
Never enter alone.

10
00:00:54,911 --> 00:00:58,403
Do not enter the water unless you absolutely have to.

11
00:01:00,503 --> 00:01:05,233
Before you go in, make sure there are no entities within 1 km of you.

12
00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:12,906
Walk. The floors are always wet.

13
00:01:15,006 --> 00:01:16,665
Enter the water by the ladder.

14
00:01:16,865 --> 00:01:17,547
Slowly.

15
00:01:19,147 --> 00:01:20,110
Never jump in.

16
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:24,264
Mark your way as you go.

17
00:01:25,264 --> 00:01:28,189
Stay where your partner can see you.

18
00:01:32,289 --> 00:01:33,729
Leave the way you came in.

19
00:01:35,529 --> 00:01:36,859
Climb out slowly.

20
00:01:38,859 --> 00:01:42,347
Dry off completely before you cross the threshold.

21
00:01:44,147 --> 00:01:46,210
Water must not leave the poolrooms.

22
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:53,199
Before you sign out, count your team.

23
00:01:55,499 --> 00:01:56,953
Then count them again.

24
00:01:59,253 --> 00:02:03,840
If the number is the same as the number that went in, you may sign out.

25
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:07,438
If it is lower, do not go back.

26
00:02:13,638 --> 00:02:14,564
If it is higher…

27
00:02:16,164 --> 00:02:17,168
…do not tell them.

28
00:02:19,268 --> 00:02:20,985
Walk to the station normally.

29
00:02:21,785 --> 00:02:23,588
Inform your supervisor.

30
00:02:27,888 --> 00:02:31,261
Sign out at reception, and write down the time.

31
00:02:32,161 --> 00:02:35,679
Personnel who do not sign out are considered still inside.

32
00:02:38,379 --> 00:02:39,004
Remember.

33
00:02:39,504 --> 00:02:40,212
Sign in.

34
00:02:40,712 --> 00:02:41,688
Stay together.

35
00:02:42,188 --> 00:02:43,101
Stay dry.

36
00:02:43,601 --> 00:02:44,525
Count twice.

37
00:02:45,025 --> 00:02:45,776
Sign out.

38
00:02:47,876 --> 00:02:52,061
This concludes your orientation. Thank you for your service.

